    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\nIf you have this repo forked, the periodically run workflow for Coverity Scan creates a lot of spammy emails about that workflow failing, due to a missing secret token for Coverity.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nCheck for the presence of `COVERITY_SCAN_TOKEN` and `COVERITY_SCAN_EMAIL` at the very start of `.github/workflows/coverity.yml`, skip the rest of the workflow if they are absent (unfortunately, Github Actions don't offer a straightforward way of doing that, so I had to rely on [this workaround](https://github.com/orgs/community/discussions/25280)).\r\n\r\nRef: https://github.com/vim/vim/pull/11604\r\nRef: https://github.com/vim/vim/pull/11609",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-13T13:59:31Z",
